      "message": "This naming is super confusing because Minikin has an `isEmojiBase` function which tests for `UCHAR_EMOJI_MODIFIER_BASE`. If it is possible to just change `isEmoji` to return true for `UCHAR_EMOJI` without breaking any current users, that would be better than adding this new name.",
