      "side": 1,
      "message": "Honestly I am not sure about our current users anymore. I didn\u0027t know about Minikin (and yes, it makes the naming very confusing). The truth is that a user should not use isEmoji at all since it could lead to problems like I am trying to solve here.\nI could go with isEmojiComponentBase? And change isEmoji to return true only for UCHAR_EMOJI. (Two methods doing the same but I want to be more clear with what I am doing).",
