      "writtenOn": "2023-11-22T20:35:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d like to keep the names as close as possible to https://unicode.org/reports/tr51/#Emoji_Properties_and_Data_Files. If we\u0027re changing `isEmoji` as done here, then we can just remove this `isEmojiBase` / `IsEmojiComponentBase`. I don\u0027t want to add something with the name `IsEmojiComponentBase` since that\u0027s even more confusingly different from the terms used by Unicode and ICU.\n\nIn other words, at this point I think we can just not add this new method.",
      "parentUuid": "93c99a6f_5e567491",
